OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFunicular carriages back on tracks
OL,4,Aafter works
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo funicular carriages which transport
OL,7,Fpeople from the Folkstone seafront to
OL,8,Fthe promenade have been lifted back on
OL,9,Fto their tracks after undergoing a
OL,10,Frevamp.
OL,12,FThe coaches were removed from the Leas
OL,13,FLift in February 2025 and have since
OL,14,Fundergone an extensive rebuild,
OL,15,Fincluding improvements to safety,
OL,16,Fdurability and accessibility.
OL,18,FWorkers had initially planned to
OL,19,Frestore the carriages' timber tops, but
OL,20,Fonce removed and inspected, it became
OL,21,Fclear they were beyond repair and would
OL,22,Fnot have been safe to reinstate.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
