OL,3,GNEWSAFunicular carriages back on tracks
OL,4,Aafter works
OL,5,
OL,6,FCathy Beare, Chair of Trustees of the
OL,7,FFolkestone Leas Lift Company Charity,
OL,8,Fsaid: "Seeing the carriages return to
OL,9,FFolkestone is a hugely significant
OL,10,Fmoment."
